meta {
  name: Get Patient Vaccines & Immunization Documents
  type: http
  seq: 12
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/patients/:patientId/vaccine-documents
  body: none
  auth: inherit
}

params:path {
  patientId: {{patientId}}
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  Gets a list of vaccine and immunization documents for the patient by ID. These can be downloaded via their `url` property. Partner-facing document display text fields are returned without literal `|` separators. Identifiers, URLs, statuses, dates, splice metadata, and source metadata are preserved as received.

  ### Fields

  | Field | Description |
  |---|---|
  | `patientId` | Unique identifier of the patient. |

  ### Example response 200 OK

  ```json
  {
    "partnerPatientId": "118613f3-41b4-a347-c90c-ad176bdca3f0",
    "vaccineDocuments": [
      {
